<title>USA: Natl Diagnostics cuts warrant strike price.</title>
<headline>Natl Diagnostics cuts warrant strike price.</headline>
<dateline>BRANDON, Fla. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Diagnostics Inc said on Friday that its directors had decided to temporarily reduce the exercise price for all the company's outstanding warrants to $1.50 from $3.00 a common share.</p>
<p>The reduction in price will be effective July 1 through July 31, the diagnostic imaging services company said in a statement. On July 31, the strike price for all warrants remaining will be $3.00 per share, it said.</p>
</text>
